Your account has been deleted
=============================

As you asked, your PreTeXt.Plus account (<%= @user.email %>) has been
deleted. Your public profile and published outputs are no longer available.

On <%= @user.purge_at.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>, your account and all of your projects,
including every file uploaded to them, will be permanently deleted. They
cannot be recovered after that.

If you change your mind before then, sign in to reactivate your account.
Everything will be exactly as you left it:

<%= new_user_session_url %>

If you didn't delete your account, sign in and reactivate it right away,
then change your password.

You are receiving this because you deleted your account on PreTeXt.Plus
(https://pretext.plus).
